    "description": "<b><font color=\"#e90707\">Tancha Halloween Watch Face</font></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Let the enchantment of dark nights come alive on your watch face! \r\nTancha Halloween Watch Face offers a spooky and fun-filled collection of watch faces specially designed for Wear OS. \r\nFill your watch face with specially crafted designs inspired by classic horror movie scenes and holiday excitement. \r\nUpdate your wrist's style every day with a new spooky theme. Are you ready for Halloween? \r\nFeel the holiday season on your wrist with Tancha. Are you brave enough?</b>\r\n\r\nThis watch face is developed by Tancha Watch Faces for use on Wear OS devices.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#e90707\">FEATURES</font></b>\r\n<b>Digital watch face</b>\r\n<font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> 12hr/24hr time format.\r\n<font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> Always on view.\r\n\r\nFAQ :\r\n1- The watch face is installed on your watch but does not appear in the catalog?\r\n\r\nFOLLOW THESE STEPS:\r\n\r\nPress and hold your watch screen.\r\nSwipe right until you see the text 'Add watch face.'\r\nPress the '+ Add watch face' button.\r\nFind and activate the watch face you installed.\r\n\r\n2- If the companion app is installed but the watch face is not, follow the steps below:\r\n\r\nFOLLOW THESE STEPS:\r\n\r\nOpen the companion app on your phone (ensure that your smartwatch is connected to your phone).\r\nNext, tap the 'INSTALL WATCH FACE ON WATCH' button at the bottom of the app.\r\nThis will open the Play Store on your WEAR OS smartwatch, displaying the purchased watch face and allowing you to install it directly.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or requests, please don't hesitate to get in touch with me at tanchawatch@gmail.com. \r\n\r\nThank you sincerely for your support.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nTancha Watch Faces",
